+/* universe pcall runs the chunk inline and parks the result here;    */
+/* __POLL__ reads it, __REARM__ fires the same staged chunk again,    */
+/* __DISARM__ unpatches. __ARMG__ <hexG> pins the universe filter.    */
+/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
